&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;myTitle&quot; style=&quot;display: none;&quot;&gt;蓝宝石&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;myClass&quot; style=&quot;display: none;&quot;&gt;Euclid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;myPreview&quot; style=&quot;display: none;&quot;&gt;蓝宝石之雾，摧毁一切。&lt;/span&gt;by [[*user ]]&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
