&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;myTitle&quot; style=&quot;display: none;&quot;&gt;帷幕破碎&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;myClass&quot; style=&quot;display: none;&quot;&gt;Euclid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;myPreview&quot; style=&quot;display: none;&quot;&gt;长夜漫漫，灯火正在熄灭，我此生将看不到它亮起。&lt;/span&gt;by [[*user ]]&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
